  "details": "Voice visemes are no longer responsive in Proton as they were in June 2021. I first noticed this bug during Furality in November 2021 and the issue persists today. Even if you do not fix this bug yourself, if you have any info on what changed, I would really appreciate that so that I can file the bug report in Proton, Wine, or in whichever viseme solution you used so that we can fix it ourselves. If you fix this issue and the Waterfox issue (https://feedback.vrchat.com/website-bug-reports/p/log-in-site-not-reachable-on-pale-moon-browser), I will re-subscribe to VRChat+. You have lost approximately $79.92 by being unresponsive to issues at this point in time.",
